   "sugya": "chullin_69a_behema_babehema",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "schema",
     "object": "hk_temura_lemaaser",
     "kind": "hekesh",
     "status": "stands",
     "gloss_en": "מקיש תמורה למעשר: מה מעשר אינו נוהג באברים ועוברים, אף תמורה אינה נוהגת באברים ועוברים"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_rav_shimi_r_shimon_hi",
     "gloss_en": "לעולם כדקאמרת מעיקרא, ודקא קשיא לך אין ממירין -- הא מני? רבי שמעון היא, דמקיש תמורה למעשר",
     "answers": "obj_yamiru_bo",
     "restores": "p_d1_behema_babehema"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ein_memirin_r_shimon",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Shimi bar Ashi: whose is 'one does not substitute'? It is R' Shimon's"
    }
   ]
  },
  "3": {
   "segId": "Chullin.69b.4",
   "sugya": "chullin_69a_behema_babehema",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_mana_teimra_r_yosei",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ומנא תימרא, דתנן: אמר רבי יוסי והלא במוקדשים ... -- R' Yosei's והלא answers someone who rejects limb-substitution yet holds a limb consecrates all: that is R' Shimon",
     "supports": "p_ein_memirin_r_shimon",
     "status": "rejected"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ryosei_regel_temura",
     "gloss_en": "R' Yosei: with consecrated things, one who says 'its leg is an olah' -- all of it is an olah; so when he says 'the leg of this in place of that', all of it should be a substitute"
    }
   ]
  },
  "8": {
   "segId": "Chullin.69b.9",
   "sugya": "chullin_69a_behema_babehema",
   "marks": [
    {
